---
---

<section class="notice-bento no-print" aria-label="Instrucciones de inscripción">
  <div class="notice-main">
    <div class="notice-icon-svg" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
        <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
        <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="notice-text">
      <span class="notice-kicker">Normativa de Mesas Examinadoras</span>
      <p>
        Registrá una solicitud <strong>por cada asignatura</strong> a rendir. El sistema conserva localmente tu legajo durante la sesión para agilizar inscripciones múltiples.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="draft-status-pill" id="draft-restored-banner" hidden aria-live="polite">
    <div class="draft-status-left">
      <span class="draft-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span id="draft-restored-text">Legajo activo en este dispositivo</span>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="btn-clear-draft" id="btn-clear-draft">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="13" height="13" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 6h18"></path>
        <path d="M19 6v14c0 1-1 2-2 2H7c-1 0-2-1-2-2V6"></path>
        <path d="M8 6V4c0-1 1-2 2-2h4c1 0 2 1 2 2v2"></path>
      </svg>
      <span>Cambiar alumno</span>
    </button>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .notice-bento {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.15rem;
  }

  .notice-main {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--bento-border);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--brand-accent);
    padding: 0.9rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
  }

  .notice-icon-svg {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--brand-accent-light);
    color: var(--brand-accent);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.1rem;
  }

  .notice-kicker {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--brand-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.12rem;
  }

  .notice-text p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .draft-status-pill {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid var(--bento-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-main);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
  }

  .draft-status-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .draft-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--feedback-success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(21, 128, 61, 0.16);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  #draft-restored-text {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .btn-clear-draft {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    background: #f8fafc;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-clear-draft:hover {
    background: var(--feedback-error-bg);
    color: var(--feedback-error);
    border-color: #fca5a5;
  }
</style>
